A few claimed fixes are already showing gaps: the attestation records BLAS/thread data but does not compare those fields, several stage manifests omit `campaign_file_shas()`, and stale claim language remains in executable module docstrings. I’m now checking whether these are isolated documentation slips or whether they change the campaign’s actual estimands/outputs.
